5. fs_LR 32k template meshes downloaded by download_fs_LR_32_meshes()
---------------------------------------------------------------------

These functions download the standard fs_LR 32k cortical surface meshes
(white, pial, inflated, very inflated, midthickness, sphere, and flat). The
meshes were created by the Van Essen Lab et al. as part of Caret / Connectome
Workbench / HCP Pipelines, and are widely used subject to the HCP Open Access
Data Use Terms (https://www.humanconnectome.org/license). No license file was
found in the source repository (https://github.com/DiedrichsenLab/fs_LR_32).
See inst/extdata/attribution/fs_LR_32/surf/fs_LR_32k.attribution.json.
Please cite:

  * Van Essen DC, et al. The WU-Minn Human Connectome Project: An overview.
    NeuroImage 2013;80:62-79.
  * Van Essen DC, et al. Parcellations and hemispheric asymmetries of human
    cerebral cortex analyzed on surface-based atlases. Cereb Cortex
    2012;22(10):2241-2262.


