7. Availability
---------------

None of the optional data files described above are part of the fsbrain
package itself. They are downloaded on demand from a public web server
(https://rcmd.org/projects/nitestdata/) into a local package file cache managed
by the 'pkgfilecache' package. Users must comply with the respective licenses
of the data they download.
